nifu kurasa moja kwa moja kwenye kihariri kwa kutumia vizuizi vya haraka na visivyo na alama za kiutafutaji. Kila kitu unachojenga hutafsiriwa na Tranzly.','%s is made by the same team and works alongside this plugin.'=>'%s imetengenezwa na timu ile ile na inafanya kazi pamoja na programu-jalizi hii.','Agree to connecting this site first.'=>'Kubali kuunganisha tovuti hii kwanza.','Enter a valid e-mail address.'=>'Weka barua pepe halali.','Agree to sending support information first.'=>'Kubali kutuma maelezo ya usaidizi kwanza.','Write a subject and a message.'=>'Andika mada na ujumbe.','Enter an e-mail address support can reply to.'=>'Weka barua pepe ambayo usaidizi unaweza kujibu.','Temporary support access created by the site owner. It is deleted automatically when it expires.'=>'Ufikiaji wa usaidizi wa muda ulioundwa na mmiliki wa tovuti. Unafutwa kiotomatiki muda wake unapoisha.','Choose 1, 3 or 7 days.'=>'Chagua siku 1, 3 au 7.','Only a site administrator, signed in to this screen, can create temporary support access.'=>'Ni msimamizi wa tovuti tu, ambaye ameingia kwenye skrini hii, anayeweza kuunda ufikiaji wa usaidizi wa muda.','A unique user name could not be chosen. Try again.'=>'Jina la kipekee la mtumiaji halikuweza kuchaguliwa. Jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® support (temporary)'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn Digital® (wa muda)','This temporary support access has expired.'=>'Upatikanaji huu wa usaidizi wa muda umeisha muda wake.','AI providers'=>'Watoa huduma za AI','The makers of ChatGPT. A good all-rounder.'=>'Waundaji wa ChatGPT. Kifaa kizuri cha matumizi yote.','The makers of Claude. Strong at writing and careful reasoning.'=>'Watengenezaji wa Claude. Wana nguvu katika uandishi na hoja makini.','Google\'s Gemini models. Fast and inexpensive.'=>'Miundo ya Gemini ya Google. Haraka na ya gharama nafuu.','A European AI company with fast, inexpensive models.'=>'Kampuni ya Uropa ya AI yenye mifumo ya haraka na ya bei nafuu.','Low-cost models that are good at writing and code.'=>'Mifumo ya bei ya chini ambayo ni mizuri katika uandishi na msimbo.','One key for models from many different providers.'=>'Ufunguo mmoja kwa ajili ya mifモデル kutoka kwa watoa huduma mbalimbali.','Any service that works like OpenAI\'s API, including a model running on your own computer or server.'=>'Huduma yoyote inayofanya kazi kama API ya OpenAI, ikiwa ni pamoja na mtindo unaofanya kazi kwenye kompyuta au seva yako mwenyewe.','General (used when nothing more specific is set)'=>'Jumla (inatum。「tumika wakati hakuna maalum zaidi iliyowekwa」)','Writing and rewriting'=>'Kuandika na kuandika upya','Translation'=>'Tafsiri','Code and CSS'=>'Nambari ya siri na CSS','Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufikia ukurasa huu.','These settings are shared by every plugin that uses them: %s.'=>'Mipangilio hii inashirikiwa na kila programu-jalizi inayozitumia: %s.','Your keys are encrypted in this site\'s database and are only ever sent to the provider you chose — never to us.'=>'Ufunguo wako umesimbwa kwa njia fiche katika hifadhidata ya tovuti hii na hutumwa tu kwa mtoa huduma uliyemchagua — kamwe hawatumwi kwetu.','Step 1 of 2: choose an AI provider'=>'Hatua ya 1 kati ya 2: chagua mtoa huduma wa AI','You bring your own key, so you pay the provider directly for what you use. Not sure? Any of these works well; you can add more later.'=>'Unaleta ufunguo wako mwenyewe, kwa hiyo unamlipa mtoa huduma moja kwa moja kwa kile unachotumia. Huwa na uhakika? Yoyote kati ya hizi inafanya kazi vizuri; unaweza kuongeza nyingine baadaye.','Next'=>'Ifanye Ifuatayo','Step 2 of 2: connect %s'=>'Hatua ya 2 kati ya 2: unganisha %s','Enter the address of your OpenAI-compatible service, ending in /v1. A key is only needed if the service asks for one.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako inayooana na OpenAI, inayomalizika kwa /v1. Ufunguo unahitajika tu ikiwa huduma inaomba mmoja.','Open %s and sign in (or create a free account).'=>'Fungua %s na uingie (au ufungue akaunti ya bure).','the %s API keys page'=>'kurasa ya funguo za API za %s','Create a new key and copy it.'=>'Tengeneza ufunguo mpya kisha uunakili.','Paste it below and press "Save and test". We send one tiny request to check it works.'=>'Bandika hapa chini kisha ubonyeze "Hifadhi na ujaribu". Tunatuma ombi moja dogo ili kuangalia kama inafanya kazi.','Most providers need a little credit on the account before a key works: %s.'=>'Watoa huduma wengi wanahitaji mkopo kidogo kwenye akaunti kabla ya ufunguo kufanya kazi: %s.','add credit'=>'ongeza mkopo','← Choose a different provider'=>'← Chagua mtoa huduma mwingine','Address'=>'Anwani','Saved key ends in …%s — paste a new one to replace it'=>'Ufunguo uliyohifadhi unaishia katika …%s — bandika mpya ili kuubadilisha','Key (optional)'=>'Ufunguo (si lazima)','API key'=>'Ufunguo wa API','Save and test'=>'Hifadhi na jaribu','Providers'=>'Watoaji huduma','Provider'=>'Mtoa Huduma','Status'=>'Hali','Key'=>'Ufunguo','Get a key'=>'Pata ufunguo','Test'=>'Jaribu','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Saved by a newer plugin version: update this plugin, or enter the key again.'=>'Imesohifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la programu-jalizi: sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo tena.','The saved key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again.'=>'Ufunguo uliookolewa hauwezi kufunguliwa tena (funguo za usalama za tovuti zilibadilika). Ingiza tena.','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Connected — last test passed %s'=>'Imeunganishwa — jaribio la mwisho limefaulu %s','Last test failed: %s'=>'Jaribio la mwisho limeshindwa: %s','Connected — not tested yet'=>'Imeunganishwa — haijajaribiwa bado','Which model to use'=>'Mtindo gani wa kutumia','★ marks our recommendation for that task. The list includes every model your key can use, read live from the provider.'=>'★ inaashiria pendekezo letu kwa kazi hiyo. Orodha hiyo inajumuisha kila modeli ambayo ufunguo wako unaweza kutumia, iliyosomwa moja kwa moja kutoka kwa mtoa huduma.','— Recommended for the provider —'=>'— Inapendekezwa kwa mtoa huduma —','Save models'=>'Hifadhi mifano','Refresh the model lists from the providers'=>'Onyesha upya orodha za mifni kutoka kwa watoa huduma','Images'=>'Picha','Connect OpenAI or Google Gemini to make images.'=>'Unganisha OpenAI au Google Gemini ili kuunda picha.','— The newest image model of the first connected provider —'=>'— Mfano mpya zaidi wa picha wa mtoa huduma wa kwanza aliyeunganishwa —','best quality'=>'ubora bora','lowest cost'=>'gharama ya chini kabisa','fastest'=>'ya kasi zaidi','Add a model yourself'=>'Ongeza modeli mwenyewe','A model came out today? Paste its exact name to use it straight away.'=>'Modeli imetoka leo? Bandika jina lake kamili ili uitumie mara moja.','Model name'=>'Jina la mfano','Add model'=>'Ongeza modeli','Recommended models list'=>'Orodha ya mifano inayopendekezwa','The recommended models list could not be verified, so no recommendations are shown. Reinstall the plugin, or turn on daily updates below.'=>'Orodha ya miundo inayopendekezwa haikuweza kuthibitishwa, kwa hiyo hakuna mapendekezo yanayoonyeshwa. Sakinisha tena programu-jalizi, au uwashe masasisho ya kila siku hapa chini.','The list in use was published on %s. Each plugin update brings a fresh one.'=>'Orodha inayotumika ilichapishwa mnamo %s. Kila sasisho la programu-jalizi huleta mpya.','Also check Zinn Digital® once a day for an updated list.'=>'Pia angalia Zinn Digital® mara moja kwa siku kwa orodha iliyosasishwa.','Only a plain download request is sent: no key, no site address, nothing about your content. The list is signed, and a list that fails the signature check is ignored.'=>'Ombi la upakuaji wa kawaida tu ndilo linalotumwaje: hakuna ufunguo, hakuna anwani ya tovuti, hakuna chochote kuhusu maudhui yako. Orodha hiyo imetiwa saini, na orodha ambayo inashindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi hupuuzwa.','Last checked %1$s: %2$s.'=>'Ilichunguzwa mwisho %1$s: %2$s.','Save, and check now if turned on'=>'Hifadhi, na uangalie sasa ikiwa imewashwa','a newer list was installed'=>'orododha mpya zaidi imewekwa','already up to date'=>'imesasasishwa kabisa','the download failed the signature check and was ignored'=>'upakuaji umeshindwa ukaguzi wa sahihi na umepuuzwa','Zinn Digital® could not be reached; the current list stays in use'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuwezi kufikiwa; orodha ya sasa inaendelea kutumika','turned off'=>'imezimwa','Open'=>'Fungua','Check their status page'=>'Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali','Open your billing page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa malipo','Open your API keys page'=>'Fungua ukurasa wako wa funguo za API','Open the AI settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio ya AI','Sorry, you are not allowed to do that.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kufanya hivyo.','Unknown provider.'=>'Mtoa huduma asiyejulikana.','Enter the address of your service, for example http://localhost:11434/v1.'=>'Weka anwani ya huduma yako, kwa mfano http://localhost:11434/v1.','That does not look like an API key. Copy it again, without spaces.'=>'Hiyo haionekani kama ufunguo wa API. Nakili tena, bila nafasi.','Paste your API key first.'=>'Bandika ufunguo wako wa API kwanza.','Key removed.'=>'Ufunguo umeondolewa.','Models saved.'=>'Modeli zimehifadhiwa.','Enter the model\'s exact name, for example as the provider\'s documentation writes it.'=>'Weka jina halisi la modeli, kwa mfano kama nyaraka za mtoa huduma zinavyoandika.','Added %s. Choose it under "Which model to use".'=>'%s imeongezwa. Ichague chini ya "Which model to use".','Model removed.'=>'Modeli imeondolewa.','Daily updates are off. The list that came with the plugin is used.'=>'Sasisho za kila siku zimezimwa. Orodha iliyokuja na programu-jalizi inatumika.','Checked: %s.'=>'Imetejwa: %s.','Model lists refreshed.'=>'Orodha za miundo zimesasishwa.','Your AI key was saved by a newer version of one of your plugins. Update this plugin, or enter the key again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI umehifadhiwa na toleo jipya zaidi la moja ya programu-jalizi zako. Sasisha programu-jalizi hii, au uweke ufunguo huo tena katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your saved AI key can no longer be opened (the site\'s security keys changed). Enter it again in the AI settings.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI uliohifadhiwa hauwezi tena kufunguliwa (funguo za usalama za tovuti zimebadilika). Weka upya katika mipangilio ya AI.','AI is not set up yet. Add a key for an AI provider in the AI settings.'=>'AI bado haijasanidiwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa mtoa huduma wa AI katika mipangilio ya AI.','No model is chosen for this task. Pick one in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mfano ulioteuliwa kwa kazi hii. Chagua moja katika mipangilio ya AI.','That AI provider is not supported by this version of the plugin.'=>'Mtoa huduma huyo wa AI hautumiki na toleo hili la programu-jalizi.','No AI provider that can make images is connected. Add an OpenAI or Google Gemini key in the AI settings.'=>'Hakuna mtoa huduma wa AI anayeweza kutengeneza picha aliyeunganishwa. Ongeza ufunguo wa OpenAI au Google Gemini katika mipangilio ya AI.','This AI provider cannot make images. Choose OpenAI or Google Gemini for images in the AI settings.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI huyu hawezi kutengeneza picha. Chagua OpenAI au Google Gemini kwa ajili ya picha katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your AI key cannot use any image model. Check the key\'s permissions with the provider, or choose another provider for images.'=>'Ufunguo wako wa AI hauwezi kutumia mtindo wowote wa picha. Angalia ruhusa za ufunguo huo kwa mtoa huduma, au chagua mtoa huduma mwingine kwa ajili ya picha.','This site could not reach your AI service. Check that it is running and that its address is reachable from your web server (a service on your own computer is not reachable from a hosted site).'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia huduma yako ya AI. Hakikisha kuwa inafanya kazi na kwamba anwani yake inaweza kufikiwa kutoka kwa seva yako ya mtandao (huduma iliyo kwenye kompyuta yako mwenyewe haiwezi kufikiwa kutoka kwa tovuti inayopangishwa).','This site could not reach %s. Check their status page; if they are up, your host may be blocking outgoing connections, or the address is wrong.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kufikia %s. Angalia ukurasa wao wa hali; ikiwa iko hewani, mwenyeji wako anaweza kuwa anazuia miunganisho ya kutoa, au anwani si sahihi.','%s says your account has no credit or quota left. Add credit or raise your limit in your account with them, then try again.'=>'%s inasema kuwa akaunti yako haina salio au kiwango kilichobaki. Ongeza salio au ongeza kikomo chako katika akaunti yako nao, kisha jaribu tena.','%s did not accept your key. It may be mistyped, revoked or expired. Create a new key and paste it here.'=>'%s haikukubali ufunguo wako. Huenda umekosewa kuandikwa, umebatilishwa au umekwisha muda wake. Unda ufunguo mpya na ubandike hapa.','%s refused this request for your key. The key may not have access to this model or feature, or your account needs verifying.'=>'%s imekataa ombi hili kwa ajili ya ufunguo wako. Ufunguo huenda hauna ufikiaji wa mtindo au kipengele hiki, au akaunti yako inahitaji uthibitishaji.','The model "%1$s" is not available from %2$s for your key. Choose another model in the AI settings.'=>'Mtindo "%1$s" haupatikani kutoka kwa %2$s kwa ufunguo wako. Chagua mtindo mwingine katika mipangilio ya AI.','Your %2$s plan does not include the model "%1$s". Choose another model in the AI settings, or upgrade your plan with them.'=>'Mpango wako wa %2$s haujumuishi modeli ya "%1$s". Chagua modeli nyingine katika mipangilio ya AI, au boresha mpango wako nao.','%s is limiting how fast your key can send requests. Wait a minute and try again, or raise your rate limit with them.'=>'%s inazuza kasi ya ufunguo wako kutuma maombi. Subiri dakika moja kisha ujaribu tena, au ongeza kiwango chako cha kikomo nao.','%s is having problems right now (an outage or overload on their side). Nothing is wrong with your settings. Try again shortly.'=>'%s inapata shida kwa sasa (kukatika kwa mtandao au mzigo mkubwa upande wao). Hakuna tatizo na mipangilio yako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni.','The AI request failed for a reason we could not identify. Try again; if it keeps happening, contact support with the details below.'=>'Ombi la AI limeshindwa kwa sababu hatikuweza kuiteua. Jaribu tena; likiendelea kutokea, wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja ukiwa na maelezo yaliyo hapa chini.','The AI provider answered in a form this plugin could not read. Try again; if it keeps happening, choose another model or contact support.'=>'Mtoa huduma wa AI amejibu kwa mfumo ambao programu-jalizi hii haikuweza kusoma. Jaribu tena; ikiwa itaendelea kutokea, chagua mtindo mwingine au wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Custom (OpenAI-compatible)'=>'Maalum (Inayoendana na OpenAI)','Save a key for this provider first.'=>'Hifadhi ufunguo kwa mtoa huduma huyu kwanza.','Your key works, but the provider lists no text model for it. Add a model yourself below.'=>'Ufunguo wako unafanya kazi, lakini mtoa huduma hajaorodhesha mfano wa maandishi kwa ajili yake. Ongeza mfano mwenyewe hapa chini.','Connected. %1$s answered using %2$s. Your AI features are ready to use.'=>'Imeunganishwa. %1$s amejibu kwa kutumia %2$s. Vipengele vyako vya AI viko tayari kutumika.','Your user role is not allowed to use AI on this site. Ask an administrator.'=>'Wajibu wako wa mtumiaji hauruhusiwi kutumia AI kwenye tovuti hii. Uliza msimamizi.','This site has reached its monthly AI spending limit. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha matumizi ya AI ya kila mwezi. Msimamizi anaweza kukiinua katika mipangilio ya AI.','This site has reached its monthly limit of AI requests. An administrator can raise it in the AI settings.'=>'Tovuti hii imefikia kikomo chake cha kila mwezi cha maombi ya AI. Msimamizi anaweza kukiongeza katika mipangilio ya AI.','Usage and cost'=>'Matumizi na gharama','The log, limits and role permissions apply to AI used through: %s.'=>'Kumbukumbu, vikomo na ruhusa za nafasi hutumika kwa AI inayotumiwa kupitia: %s.','Costs are approximate, worked out from published prices; a model with no known price counts as zero.'=>'Gharama ni za makisio, zimehesabiwa kutoka kwa bei zilizochapishwa; mfano ambao hauna bei inayojulikana huhesabiwa kama sifuri.','This month: %1$s requests, about %2$s.'=>'Mwezi huu: maombi %1$s, takriban %2$s.','When'=>'Wakati','Who'=>'Nani','Used for'=>'Imetumika kwa','Model'=>'Mfano','Tokens in / out'=>'Ishara ndani / nje','About'=>'Kuhusu','Result'=>'Matokeo','No AI requests have been made yet.'=>'Hakuna maombi ya AI yaliyofanywa bado.','Done'=>'Imekamilika','Limits and permissions'=>'Mipaka na ruhusa','Monthly spending limit (US dollars)'=>'Kikomo cha matumizi ya kila mwezi (dola za US)','Leave empty for no limit. AI stops for the rest of the month once the approximate cost reaches it.'=>'Acha wazi kukiwa hakuna kikomo. AI inasimama kwa mwezi uliosalia mara tu gharama inayokadiriwa inapofikia kiwango hicho.','Monthly request limit'=>'Kikomo cha maombi cha kila mwezi','Leave empty for no limit.'=>'Acha wazi bila kikomo.','Who may use AI'=>'Nani anayeweza kutumia AI','Tick none to let everyone who can use the plugin\'s features use AI. Administrators can always use it.'=>'Weka alama yoyote ili kuruhusu kila mtu anayeweza kutumia vipengele vya programu-jalizi kutumia AI. Wasimamizi wanaweza kuitumia kila wakati.','Save limits and permissions'=>'Hifadhi vigezo na ruhusa','Limits and permissions saved.'=>'Vikomo na ruhusa zimehifadhiwa.','Security error, please refresh the page and try again.'=>'Hitilafu ya usalama, tafadhali weka upya ukurasa na ujaribu tena.','Missing newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Mipangilio ya jarida haipo. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Invalid newsletter settings. Please contact the admin.'=>'Mipangilio ya jarida si sahihi. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Invalid email address.'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe si sahihi.','Too many attempts. Please try again in a few minutes.'=>'Jaribio ni mengi mno. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','Something went wrong. Please contact the admin.'=>'Kuna kitu kimeenda vibaya. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Map'=>'Ramani','Background video'=>'Video ya nyuma','%1$s: %2$d font files stored, stylesheet %3$s'=>'%1$s: faili za fonti %2$d zimehifadhiwa, laha ya mitindo %3$s','That family is not stored.'=>'Familia hiyo haijahifadhiwa.','Removed.'=>'Imeondolewa.','That is not a valid font family name.'=>'Hilo sio jina sahihi la familia ya fonti.','Google Fonts did not return that family. Check the name and try again.'=>'Google Fonts haikurudisha familia hiyo. Angalia jina na ujaribu tena.','The font files could not be downloaded or saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faili za fonti hazikuweza kupakuliwa au kuhifadhiwa. Hakikisha kuwa folda ya kupakia inaweza kuandikika.','The font stylesheet could not be saved. Check that the uploads folder is writable.'=>'Faili la mtindo wa fonti halikuweza kuhifadhiwa. Hakikisha kuwa folda ya kupakia ina ruhusa ya kuandikwa.','Dismiss this notice'=>'Odoa taarifa hii','Design'=>'Muundo','Content'=>'Maudhui','Media'=>'Vyombo vya habari','Marketing'=>'Masoko','Site'=>'Tovuti','Data'=>'Data','The admin screen\'s scripts are missing from this copy of the plugin. Reinstall it from a released package.'=>'Skripti za skrini ya msimamizi hazipo kwenye nakala hii ya programu-jalizi. Isakinishe upya kutoka kwenye kifurushi kilichotolewa.','This screen needs JavaScript.'=>'Skrini hii inahitaji JavaScript.','Languages'=>'Lugha','The prefix must be 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, start with a letter, and must not name the plugin.'=>'Kiambishi awali lazima kiwe na herufi 1 hadi 8 ndogo au tarakimu, kianze na herufi, na kisiwe jina la programu-jalizi.','You are not allowed to edit this item.'=>'Huruhusiwi kuhariri kipengele hiki.','You are not allowed to do this.'=>'Huruhusu kufanya hivi.','Safe mode was turned off because it no longer matches your login. Reload the page.'=>'Hali salama imezimwa kwa sababu hailingani tena na kuingia kwako. Pakia upya ukurasa.','Only an administrator can use safe mode.'=>'Ni msimamizi pekee anayeweza kutumia hali salama.','Safe mode needs a normal browser login.'=>'Hali salama inahitaji kuingia kwenye kivinjari cha kawaida.','Safe mode could not be set up.'=>'Hali salama haikuweza kusanidiwa.','Safe mode needs write access to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Hali salama inahitaji idhini ya kuandika kwenye folda ya wp-content/mu-plugins.','Safe mode could not write to the wp-content/mu-plugins folder.'=>'Hali salama haikuweza kuandika kwenye folda ya wp-content/mu-plugins.','Sandwich Studio'=>'Sandwich Studio','That page does not exist, or it has been deleted.'=>'Ukurasa huo haupo, au umefutwa.','Sorry, you are not allowed to edit this item in Sandwich Studio.'=>'Samahani, huruhusiwi kuhariri kipengele hiki katika Sandwich Studio.','Sandwich Studio is not built. Reinstall the plugin.'=>'Sandwich Studio haijajengwa. Sakinisha tena programu-jalizi.','Add title'=>'Ongeza kichwa','Type / to choose a block'=>'Andika / ili kuchagua kizuizi','Loading Sandwich Studio…'=>'Inapakia Sandwich Studio…','Sandwich Studio needs JavaScript. Use the normal editor instead.'=>'Sandwich Studio inahitaji JavaScript. Tumia kihariri cha kawaida badala yake.','Edit “%s” with Sandwich Studio'=>'Hariri “%s” ukitumia Sandwich Studio','Edit with Sandwich Studio'=>'Hariri kwa Sandwich Studio','Blank canvas'=>'Turubai tupu','The tablet width must be a whole number of pixels from 480 to 2560.'=>'Upana wa kompyuta kibao lazima uwe nambari kamili ya saizi kutoka 480 hadi 2560.','The mobile width must be a whole number of pixels, at least 240 and smaller than the tablet width.'=>'Upana wa simu ya mkononi lazima uwe namba kamili ya saizi (pixels), angalau 240 na mdogo kuliko upana wa kompyuta kibao.','Each custom breakpoint needs its own id: 2 to 12 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila sehemu maalum ya mapumziko inahitaji kitambulisho chake: herufi ndogo 2 hadi 12 au nambari, zinazoanza na herufi.','A custom breakpoint applies either up to a width (200 to 4000 pixels) or from a width (200 to 6000 pixels), not both.'=>'Sehemu maalum ya kukata inatumika ama hadi upana fulani (kutoka pikseli 200 hadi 4000) au kuanzia upana fulani (kutoka pikseli 200 hadi 6000), lakini sio zote mbili.','Tablet'=>'Kompyuta kibao','Mobile'=>'Simu ya mkononi','Site design'=>'Muundo wa tovuti','Colours, fonts and styles shared by every page of the site and by your theme.'=>'Rangi, fonti na mitindo inayoshirikiwa na kila ukurasa wa tovuti na na mandhari yako.','The site\'s global styles could not be opened.'=>'Mitindo ya jumla ya tovuti haikuweza kufunguliwa.','That font is not one of the site\'s fonts.'=>'Fonti hiyo si mojawapo ya fonti za tovuti.','Each colour needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kila rangi inahitaji jina la kipekee linaloundwa na herufi ndogo, namba na vistari.','The colour "%s" is not a valid CSS colour.'=>'Rangi "%s" si rangi halali ya CSS.','Each font needs a unique name made of lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'Kila fonti inahitaji jina la kipekee linaloundwa na herufi ndogo, nambari na vitenganishi.','The font stack for "%s" may contain only font names, quotes, commas and spaces.'=>'Lundo la fonti la "%s" linaweza kuwa na majina ya fonti pekee, alama za kunukuu, koma na nafasi.','Uploaded icons'=>'Aikoni zilizopakiwa','Icon'=>'Ikoni','This file is not an SVG icon we can use. It may be damaged, or it only held content that is removed for safety (scripts, links, embedded images or fonts).'=>'Faili hili si ikoni ya SVG tunayoweza kutumia. Huenda limeharibika, au lina maudhui pekee yaliyoondolewa kwa ajili ya usalama (skripti, viungo, picha zilizopachikwa au fonti).','The icon could not be deleted.'=>'Aikoni haikuweza kufutwa.','Part of the message telling the user what they should receive via email.a license key'=>'ufunguo wa leseni','A user has not yet been associated with the license, which is necessary to prevent unauthorized activation. To assign the license to your user, you agree to share your WordPress user\'s full name and email address.'=>'Mtumiaji bado hajahusishwa na leseni hiyo, jambo ambalo ni muhimu ili kuzuia uanzishaji usioidhinishwa. Ili kugawa leseni hiyo kwa mtumiaji wako, unakubali kushiriki jina kamili na anwani ya barua pepe ya mtumiaji wako wa WordPress.','the above-mentioned sites'=>'tovuti zilizotajwa hapo juu','Account'=>'Akaunti','Account Details'=>'Maelezo ya Akaunti','Account is pending activation. Please check your email and click the link to activate your account and then submit the affiliate form again.'=>'Akaunti inasubiri kuwezeshwa. Tafadhali angalia barua pepe yako na ubofye kiungo ili kuwezesha akaunti yako na kisha utume tena fomu ya washirika.','Would you like to merge %1$s into %2$s?'=>'Je, ungeenda kuunganisha %1$s katika %2$s?','Actions'=>'Vitendo','Activate'=>'Washa','Activate Free Version'=>'Washa Toleo la Bure','Activate License'=>'Washa Leseni','activate a license here'=>'amilisha leseni hapa','Please enter the license key that you received in the email right after the purchase:'=>'Tafadhali weka ufunguo wa leseni uliopokea kwenye barua pepe mara tu baada ya ununuzi:','Activate license on all sites in the network.'=>'Washa lesheni kwenye tovuti zote kwenye mtandao.','Activate license on all pending sites.'=>'Washa leseni kwenye tovuti zote zinazosubiri.',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please activate it to start benefiting from the %2$s features. %3$s'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali liwashe ili uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %2$s. %3$s',' The paid version of %1$s is already installed. Please navigate to the %2$s to activate it and start benefiting from the %3$s features.'=>'Toleo la kulipia la %1$s limesakinishwa tayari. Tafadhali nenda kwenye %2$s ili kuliwezesha na uanze kufaidika na vipengele vya %3$s.','Activate this add-on'=>'Washa nyongeza hii','Activate %s'=>'Washa %s','Activate %s features'=>'Washa vipengele vya %s','%s - plugin name. As complete "PluginX" activation nowComplete "%s" Activation Now'=>'Kamilisha Uanzishaji wa "%s" Sasa','Activate %s Plan'=>'Washa Mpango wa %s','Activated'=>'Imewashwa','Activating'=>'Inashtua','Activating license'=>'Inawasha leseni','Your account was successfully activated with the %s plan.'=>'Akaunti yako imeamilishwa kwa mafanikio ukitumia mpango wa %s.','active add-onActive'=>'Amilifu','Add another domain'=>'Ongeza kikoa kingine','Add-Ons'=>'Viongezeo','Add Ons for %s'=>'Viongezao vya %s','We couldn\'t load the add-ons list. It\'s probably an issue on our side, please try to come back in few minutes.'=>'Hatukuweza kupakia orodha ya nyongeza. Huenda hili ni tatizo kwa upande wetu, tafadhali jaribu kurudi baada ya dakika chache.','Add-On'=>'Ongeza','%s is a premium only add-on. You have to purchase a license first before activating the plugin.'=>'%s ni nyongeza ya malipo pekee. Unapaswa kununua leseni kwanza kabla ya kuwezesha programu-jalizi.','%s Add-on was successfully purchased.'=>'Ongezeko la %s limesaniriwa kwa mafanikio.','Your %s Add-on plan was successfully upgraded.'=>'Mpango wako wa nyongeza wa %s umesasishwa kwa mafanikio.','%s free trial was successfully cancelled. Since the add-on is premium only it was automatically deactivated. If you like to use it in the future, you\'ll have to purchase a license.'=>'Jaribio la bure la %s limeghairiwa kwa mafanikio. Kwa kuwa programu-jalizi hii ni ya kulipia pekee, imezimwa kiotomatiki. Ikiwa ungependa kuitumia siku za usoni, utahitaji kununua leseni.','addonX cannot run...%s cannot run without the plugin.'=>'%s haiwezi kuendesha bila programu-jalizi.','addonX cannot run without pluginY%1$s cannot run without %2$s.'=>'%1$s haiwezi kufanya kazi bila %2$s.','Just letting you know that the add-ons information of %s is being pulled from an external server.'=>'Ninakujulisha tu kwamba maelezo ya nyongeza ya %s yanachukuliwa kutoka kwa seva ya nje.','Add Ons of module %s'=>'Viongezeo vya moduli %s','Address Line %d'=>'Anwani ya Mtaa %d','Affiliate'=>'Mshirika','Due to violation of our affiliation terms, we decided to temporarily block your affiliation account. If you have any questions, please contact support.'=>'Kutokana na ukiukaji wa masharti yetu ya ushirika, tumeamua kuzuia kwa muda akaunti yako ya ushirika. Ikiwa una maswali yoyote, tafadhali wasiliana na huduma kwa wateja.','Your affiliation account was temporarily suspended.'=>'Akaunti yako ya ushirika imesimamishwa kwa muda.','Your affiliate application for %1$s has been accepted! Log in to your affiliate area at: %2$s.'=>'Maombi yako ya ushirika kwa ajili ya %1$s yamekubaliwa! Ingia kwenye eneo lako la ushirika katika: %2$s.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, unfortunately, we\'ve decided at this point to reject your application. Please try again in 30 days.'=>'Asante kwa kuomba kujiunga na mpango wetu wa washirika, kwa bahati mbaya, tumeamua kwa sasa kukataa ombi lako. Tafadhali jaribu tena baada ya siku 30.','Thank you for applying for our affiliate program, we\'ll review your details during the next 14 days and will get back to you with further information.'=>'Asante kwa kuomba kujiunga na programu yetu ya washirika, tutakagua maelezo yako katika siku 14 zijazo na kukujibu na taarifa zaidi.','%s tracking cookie after the first visit to maximize earnings potential.'=>'%s kuki ya ufuatiliaji baada ya ziara ya kwanza ili kuongeza uwezo wa mapato.','Affiliation'=>'Ushirika','Once your license expires you can still use the Free version but you will NOT have access to the %s features.'=>'Leseni yako ikiisha muda wake bado unaweza kutumia toleo la Bure lakini HUTAPATA fursa ya kutumia vipengele vya %s.','Once your license expires you will no longer be able to use the %s, unless you activate it again with a valid premium license.'=>'Mara leseni yako itakapokwisha huwe