ronment info. This will help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Jiandikishe kupata arifa za barua pepe kwa ajili ya usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara kwa mara, na ili kushiriki maelezo ya msingi ya mazingira ya WordPress. Hii itatusaidia kufanya %s iendane zaidi na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Jiandikishe ili upate arifa za barua pepe kuhusu usalama na masasisho ya vipengele, maudhui ya elimu, na matoleo ya mara kwa mara, na ili kushiriki maelezo fulani ya kimsingi ya mazingira ya WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Ukiacha hili, hakuna nchi iliyoharibika! %1$s itaendelea kufanya kazi vizuri tu.','We have introduced this opt-in so you never miss an important update and help us make the %s more compatible with your site and better at doing what you need it to.'=>'Tumeleta chaguo hili ili usipate kukosa sasisho muhimu na kutusaidia kufanya %s iendane vyema na tovuti yako na iwe bora zaidi katika kufanya kile unachohitaji ifanye.','We\'re excited to introduce the Freemius network-level integration.'=>'Tunafurahi kuanzisha ujumuishaji wa kiwango cha mtandao wa Freemius.','During the update process we detected %s site(s) in the network that are still pending your attention.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %s kwenye mtandao ambazo bado zinahitaji umakini wako.','During the update process we detected %d site(s) that are still pending license activation.'=>'Wakati wa mchakato wa kusasisha, tumetambua tovuti %d ambazo bado zinangoja kuwezeshwa kwa leseni.','If you\'d like to use the %s on those sites, please enter your license key below and click the activation button.'=>'Ikiwa ungependa kutumia %s kwenye tovuti h