ada ya dakika 60. Unaweza pia kuizima mapema kwa kubofya kiungo cha "Simamisha Utatuzi".','Date'=>'Tarehe','Deactivate'=>'Zima','Deactivate the free version'=>'Zima toleo la bure','Deactivate License'=>'Zima Leseni','Deactivating your license will block all premium features, but will enable activating the license on another site. Are you sure you want to proceed?'=>'Kuzima leseni yako kutazima vipengele vyote vya kulipia, lakini kutawezesha kuwezesha leseni kwenye tovuti nyingine. Je, una hakika unataka kuendelea?','Deactivation'=>'Kuzima','Yes - %s'=>'Ndiyo - %s','Submit & %s'=>'Wasilisha & %s','Deactivating or uninstalling the %s will automatically disable the license, which you\'ll be able to use on another site.'=>'Kuzima au kusanidua %s kutazima leseni kiotomatiki, ambayo utaweza kuitumia kwenye tovuti nyingine.','If you have a moment, please let us know why you are %s'=>'Kama una nafasi, tafadhali tujulishe kwa nini wewe ni %s','Debug Log'=>'Kumbukumbu ya Utatuzi','as code debuggingDebugging'=>'Inayoshi makosa','delegate'=>'wakilisha','If you click it, this decision will be delegated to the sites administrators.'=>'Ukibofya, uamuzi huu utakabidhiwa kwa watawala wa tovuti.','Delegate to Site Admins'=>'Kabidhi kwa Wasimamizi wa Tovuti','Delegate to Site Admins & Continue'=>'Mkabidhi Wasimamizi wa Tovuti na Uendelee','Delegating, please wait'=>'Inatoa mamlaka, tafadhali subiri','verbDelete'=>'Futa','Delete All Accounts'=>'Futa Akaunti Zote','Are you sure you want to delete all Freemius data?'=>'Una uhakika unataka kufuta data zote za Freemius?','Plugin installer section titleDescription'=>'Maelezo','Details'=>'Maelezo','seems like the key you entered doesn\'t match our records.'=>'inaonekana ufunguo ulioweka haulingani na kumbukumbu zetu.','Diagnostic Info'=>'Maelezo ya Utambuzi','Disabling white-label mode'=>'Inazima hali ya lebo nyeupe','Disconnect'=>'Tenganisha','Are you sure you would like to proceed with the disconnection?'=>'Una uhakika ungependa kuendel