ya Linapatikana','Optional'=>'Si lazima','Plan'=>'Mpango','Products'=>'Bidhaa','Sharing diagnostic data helps to provide additional functionality that\'s relevant to your website, avoid WordPress or PHP version incompatibilities that can break the website, and recognize which languages & regions the %s should be translated and tailored to.'=>'Kushiriki data ya uchunguzi husaidie kutoa utendakazi wa ziada unaofaa kwa tovuti yako, kuepuka kutopatana kwa toleo la WordPress au PHP ambako kunaweza kuvunja tovuti, na kutambua lugha na maeneo ambayo %s inapaswa kutafsiriwa na kulengwa kwayo.','So you can reuse the license when the %s is no longer active.'=>'Ili uweze kutumia tena leseni wakati %s haifanyi kazi tena.','Subscription'=>'Usajili','The %1$s will be periodically sending essential license data to %2$s to check for security and feature updates, and verify the validity of your license.'=>'%1$s itakuwa ikituma mara kwa mara data muhimu ya leseni kwenda %2$s ili kuangalia masasisho ya usalama na vipengele, na kuthibitisha uhalali wa leseni yako.','There is a %1$s of %2$s available.'=>'Kuna %1$s ya %2$s inayopatikana.','To ensure compatibility and avoid conflicts with your installed plugins and themes.'=>'Ili kuhakikisha utangamano na kuepuka migongano na programu jalizi na mandhari zako zilizosakinishwa.','Trial'=>'Jaribio','View %s State'=>'Angalia Hali ya %s','View Basic %s Info'=>'Tazama Taarifa za Msingi za %s','Yes, %2$s is a duplicate of %4$s for the purpose of testing, staging, or development.'=>'Ndiyo, %2$s ni nakala rudufu ya %4$s kwa madhumuni ya majaribio, kuandaa, au ukuzaji.','You have a %s license.'=>'Una leseni ya %s.','You have purchased a %s license.'=>'Umenunua leseni ya %s.','You should receive a confirmation email for %1$s to your mailbox at %2$s. Please make sure you click the button in that email to %3$s.'=>'Unapaswa kupokea barua pepe ya uthibitisho ya %1$s katika kisanduku chako cha barua %2$s. Tafadhali hakikisha kuwa unabonyeza kitufe kilicho kwenye barua pepe hiyo ili %3$s.','days'=>'siku','deactivating'=>'inazima','hour'=>'saa','hours'=>'saa','license'=>'leseni','optional'=>'si lazima','products'=>'bidhaa','skip'=>'ruka','subscription'=>'Usajili','trial'=>'jaribio','Clone resolution admin notice products list labelProducts'=>'Bidhaa','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Inafanya kazi','as software licenseLicense'=>'Leseni','close a windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','close windowDismiss'=>'Ondoa','like websitesSites'=>'Tovuti','nounPricing'=>'Bei','trial periodTrial'=>'Jaribio','verbOpt In'=>'Jiandikishe','verbOpt Out'=>'Jiondoe','verbSkip'=>'Ruka','verbUpgrade'=>'Boresha','x-ago%s ago'=>'%s iliyopita','A migration step is running right now. Try again in a minute.'=>'Hatua ya kuhamisha data inaendelea sasa hivi. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika moja.','Dark mode'=>'Hali ya giza','Thank you for subscribing!'=>'Asante kwa kusajili!','Something went wrong. Please contact the administrator.'=>'Kuna kitu kimeenda vibaya. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Years'=>'Miaka','Months'=>'Miezi','Weeks'=>'Wiki','Days'=>'Siku','Hours'=>'Masaa','Minutes'=>'Dakika','Seconds'=>'Sekunde','Go to slide %d'=>'Nenda kwenye slaidi %d','You\'re already subscribed to our newsletter'=>'Tayari umesajiliwa kupokea jarida letu','Email address is already subscribed.'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe tayari imesajiliwa.','MailPoet plugin not found. Please contact the admin.'=>'Program-in-soma ya MailPoet haipatikani. Tafadhali wasiliana na msimamizi.','Choose the brand fonts from the site\'s fonts.'=>'Chagua fonti za chapa kutoka kwa fonti za tovuti.','That font is no longer in the font library.'=>'Font hiyo haipo tena kwenye maktaba ya fonti.','That font has no files yet. Upload at least one.'=>'Fonti hiyo haina faili bado. Pakia angalau moja.','An Adobe Fonts kit id is 5 to 12 letters and digits, as shown in your Adobe Fonts web project.'=>'Kit kitambulisho cha Adobe Fonts kina urefu wa herufi na namba 5 hadi 12, kama inavyoonyeshwa kwenye m