'=>'Imeunganishwa. Majibu yanakwenda kwa %s.','Not connected. You can still send a request with your e-mail address below; connecting saves typing it each time.'=>'Hujaunganishwa. Bado unaweza kutuma ombi ukitumia anwani yako ya barua pepe hapa chini; kuunganishwa kunaokoa muda wa kuiandika kila wakati.','E-mail address'=>'Anwani ya barua pepe','Your name (optional)'=>'Jina lako (si lazima)','I agree to connect this site to Zinn Digital® support. It sends this site’s address, WordPress and PHP versions and the plugin version, and can be disconnected at any time from here or by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Nakubali kuunganisha tovuti hii na msaada wa Zinn Digital®. Hatua hii inatuma anwani ya tovuti hii, matoleo ya WordPress na PHP na toleo la programu-jalizi, na inaweza kukatishwa wakati wowote kutoka hapa au na Zinn Digital®.','Connect'=>'Unganisha','I need help'=>'Ninahitaji msaada','Report a bug'=>'Ripoti mdudu','Send feedback'=>'Tuma maoni','Request a feature'=>'Omba kipengele','The site details could not be read.'=>'Maelezo ya tovuti hayakuweza kusomwa.','Your request could not be sent. Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Ombi halikuweza kutumwa. Jaribu tena baada ya dakika chache.','WordPress admin'=>'Utawala wa WordPress','File manager'=>'Kidhibiti cha faili','cPanel'=>'cPanel','FTP / SFTP'=>'FTP / SFTP','Feedback and feature requests'=>'Maoni na maombi ya vipengele','Sent. Your reference is %s, and our reply will come by e-mail.'=>'Imetumwa. Rejeleo lako ni %s, na jibu letu litakuja kupitia barua pepe.','What is it about?'=>'Inahusu nini?','Reply to (e-mail)'=>'Jibu kwa (barua pepe)','Subject'=>'Mada','What did you do, what did you expect, and what happened instead?'=>'Ulifanya nini, ulitarajia nini, na badala yake nini kilitokea?','Include site details (versions, theme, plugins, error log excerpt)'=>'Jumuisha maelezo ya tovuti (matoleo, mandhari, programu-jalizi, dondoo la logi ya makosa)','See exactly what is sent'=>'Ona kile kinachotumwa haswa','Loading…'=>'Inapakia…','Logins for support (optional, stored encrypted)'=>'Taarifa za kuingia kwa ajili ya usaidizi (si lazima, zinahifadhiwa zimesimbwa kwa njia fiche)','A login is only sent with its password. Leave a row out rather than half-filled.'=>'Kuingia hutum moléculas na nenosiri lake pekee. Afadhali uache safu wazi kuliko kuijaza nusu.','Login address'=>'Anwani ya kuingia','Username'=>'Jina la mtumiaji','Password'=>'Nenosiri','Add a login'=>'Ongeza kuingia kwenye mfumo','Create a temporary support login'=>'Undha kuingia kwa usaidizi wa muda','A separate user for our support team, without access to users, plugins installation or code editing. It is deleted automatically when it expires, or whenever you revoke it below.'=>'Mtumiaji tofauti kwa ajili ya timu yetu ya usaidizi, bila ufikiaji wa watumiaji, usakinishaji wa programu jalizi au uhariri wa nambari ya programu. Inafutwa kiotomatiki muda wake ukiisha, au wakati wowote utakapoi batilisha hapa chini.','Yes, for %d day'=>'Ndiyo, kwa siku %d' . "\0" . 'Ndiyo, kwa siku %d','Send'=>'Tuma','The list could not be loaded.'=>'Orodha haikuweza kupakiwa.','That login could not be removed.'=>'Kuingia huko hakuwezi kuondolewa.','Temporary support logins'=>'Ingia za usaidizi za muda','None. Support can only log in to this site if you create a login here.'=>'Hakuna. Usaidizi unaweza kuingia kwenye tovuti hii tu ikiwa utatengeneza utambulisho wa kuingia hapa.','expired, being removed'=>'muda wake umekwisha, inaondolewa','expires %s'=>'inaisha muda %s','Revoke now'=>'Batilisha sasa','Step %1$d of %2$d'=>'Hatua ya %1$d ya %2$d','Close the tour'=>'Funga ziara','Back'=>'Rudi','Everything in one place'=>'Kila kitu mahali pamoja','These tabs lead to every screen of the plugin: setup, settings, your licence, help and more.'=>'Tepe hizi zinaelekeza kwenye kila skrini ya programu-jalizi: usanidi, mipangilio, leseni yako, msaada na mengineyo.','Help on every screen'=>'Msaada katika kila skrini','Open this menu for the guide to the screen you are on, this tour, or to ask us for help.'=>'Fungua menyu hii kwa ajili ya mwongozo wa skrini uliyomo, ziara hii, au ili kutuomba msaada.','Light or dark'=>'Mwanga au giza','Choose light, dark, or the same as your computer. Your choice is remembered for you only.'=>'Chagua mwanga, giza, au sawa na kompyuta yako. Chaguo lako linakumbukwa kwa ajili yako pekee.','Welcome'=>'Karibu','This short tour shows where things are. You can leave it at any time with Escape.'=>'Ziara hii fupi inaonyesha vitu viko wapi. Unaweza kuondoka wakati wowote kwa kubonyeza Escape.','Your site at a glance'=>'Mtandao wako kwa mtazamo mmoja','Setup progress and your plan are shown here, with the next thing worth doing.'=>'Maendeleo ya usanidi na mpango wako vinaonyeshwa hapa, pamoja na jambo linalofuata linalofaa kufanywa.','Your plan, how many sites it covers, and whether this copy of the site counts toward that limit.'=>'Mpango wako, idadi ya tovuti inazofunika, na ikiwa nakala hii ya tovuti inahesabika kwa kikomo hicho.','Try Pro or upgrade'=>'Jaribu Pro au boresha','Start a free trial without a card, upgrade, or renew, all from here.'=>'Anza jaribio la bure bila kadi, boresha, au sasisha, yote kutoka hapa.','Every feature and the plan that includes it. Search for a feature or show one area at a time.'=>'Kila kipengele na mpango unaojumuisha. Tafuta kipengele au uonyeshe eneo moja kwa wakati mmoja.','More from Zinn Digital®'=>'Zaidi kutoka Zinn Digital®','Plugins that work with this one, and services from the same team. Cards you hid on other screens can be shown again here.'=>'Programu-jalizi zinazofanya kazi na hii, na huduma kutoka kwa timu hiyo hiyo. Kadi ulizoficha kwenye skrini zingine zinaweza kuonyeshwa tena hapa.','Connect for faster help'=>'Unganisha kwa usaidizi wa haraka','Connecting is optional. It lets you send requests without typing your e-mail each time, and you can disconnect whenever you like.'=>'Kuunganisha si lazima. Inakuwezesha kutuma maombi bila kuandika barua pepe yako kila wakati, na unaweza kukata muunganisho wakati wowote upendao.','Ask for help or report a bug'=>'Omba msaada au ripoti mdudu','Describe what happened. You choose whether to attach site information, and you can see exactly what it contains first.'=>'Eleza kilichotokea. Unachagua kama ungependa kuambatisha maelezo ya tovuti, na unaweza kuona hasa kile kilicho ndani yake kwanza.','Temporary support access'=>'Upatikanaji wa usaidizi wa muda','If support needs to look inside your site, create a temporary login here. It deletes itself when it expires, and you can remove it at any time.'=>'Ikiwa usaidizi unahitaji kuangalia ndani ya tovuti yako, unda kuingia kwa muda hapa. Kujifuta yenyewe inapokwisha muda wake, na unaweza kuiondoa wakati wowote.','Tell us what to build'=>'Tuambie nini cha kujenga','Send an idea, a feature request or any feedback. It goes straight to the team.'=>'Tuma wazo, ombi la kipengele au maoni yoyote. Inakwenda moja kwa moja kwa timu.','This takes a few minutes and sets up %s so it works on this site straight away. You can change everything later.'=>'Hii inachukua dakika chache na inaweka %s ili ifanye kazi kwenye tovuti hii mara moja. Unaweza kubadilisha kila kitu baadaye.','You are ready. If anything does not work as expected, we are one click away.'=>'Uko tayari. Ikiwa kitu chochote hakifanyi kazi kama inavyotarajiwa, tuko mbali kwa mbofyo mmoja.','Step %1$d of %2$d: %3$s'=>'Hatua ya %1$d kati ya %2$d: %3$s','Finish'=>'Maliza','Skip setup'=>'Ruka usanidi','Built by Neil Lock, CEO of Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Imetengenezwa na Neil Lock, Mkurugenzi Mtendaji wa Zinn Digital® Ltd','Version %s'=>'Toleo la %s','Page Builder Sandwich website'=>'Tovuti ya Page Builder Sandwich','Zinn Digital® website'=>'Tovuti ya Zinn Digital®','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','See the Pro plans and pricing'=>'Tazama mipango ya Pro na bei','Front-end output'=>'Matokeo ya mbele','Class name prefix'=>'Kiambishi awali cha jina la darasa','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Kila jina la darasa ambalo programu-jalizi huchapisha kwenye kurasa zako linaanza na kiambishi hiki, ili kurasa zisifunue ni programu-jalizi ipi iliyozijenga. Herufi ndogo 1 hadi 8 au tarakimu, zinazoanza na herufi moja.','Save'=>'Hifadhi','Beta updates'=>'Sasisho za Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Tovuti hii hupokea matoleo ya beta kama sasisho.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Tovuti hii inapokea matoleo thabiti pekee.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Badilisha hii kwenye ukurasa wa Akaunti','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Matoleo ya Beta hutolewa kwa usakinishaji wa Pro wenye leseni ambao umeunganishwa na akaunti yao. Mara baada ya kuunganishwa, unaweza kujiunga kupitia ukurasa wa Akaunti.','Breakpoints saved. Pages pick up the new widths on their next view.'=>'Vigezo vya kukatisha vimehifadhiwa. Kurasa huchukua upana mpya katika mwonekano wao unaofuata.','Breakpoints'=>'Sehemu za Kuvunjilia mbali','Styles set for Tablet apply up to the tablet width, and styles set for Mobile up to the mobile width. Desktop styles apply everywhere else.'=>'Mitindo iliyowekwa kwa ajili ya Kompyuta Kibao inatumika hadi kufikia upana wa kompyuta kibao, na ile iliyowekwa kwa ajili ya Simu ya Mkononi hadi kufikia upana wa simu ya mkononi. Mitindo ya Kompyuta ya Mezani inatumika kwingineko kote.','Tablet: up to (px)'=>'Kompyuta kibao: hadi (px)','Mobile: up to (px)'=>'Simu ya mkononi: hadi (px)','Save breakpoints'=>'Hifadhi vituo vya kuvunja','Use the default widths'=>'Tumia upana chaguomsingi','Settings'=>'Mipangilio','The request converting this post stopped before it finished, so the post was skipped. Open it to convert it, or convert it again from here.'=>'Ombi la kubadilisha chapisho hili lilisimama kabla halijakamilika, kwa hiyo chapisho lilirukwa. Lifungue ili ulibadilishe, au ulibadilishe tena kutoka hapa.','There is no backup of this post to restore.'=>'Hakuna nakala rudufu ya chapisho hili ya kurejesha.','The converted content could not be saved.'=>'Maudhui yaliyobadilishwa hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Unknown error.'=>'Hitilafu isiyojulikana.','No legacy content has been checked yet.'=>'Hakuna maudhui ya zamani yaliyochunguzwa bado.','Restoring legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inarejesha maudhui ya zamani: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Converting legacy content: %1$d of %2$d posts.'=>'Inabadilisha maudhui ya zamani: machapisho %1$d kati ya %2$d.','Undo finished: %1$d restored, %2$d failed.'=>'Tendua imekamilisha: %1$d zimerejeshwa, %2$d zimeshindwa.','Conversion finished: %1$d converted, %2$d unchanged, %3$d failed.'=>'Ubadilishaji umekamilika: %1$d imebadilishwa, %2$d haijabadilishwa, %3$d imeshindwa.','Legacy content'=>'Maudhui ya zamani','Pages made with earlier versions of Page Builder Sandwich are converted to blocks in the background. Every post is backed up first, so each conversion can be undone.'=>'Kurasa zilizoundwa kwa matoleo ya awali ya Page Builder Sandwich zinabadilishwa kuwa vizuizi kwa nyuma. Kila chapisho hifadhi rudufu yake inatengenezwa kwanza, kwa hivyo kila mabadiliko yanaweza kutenduliwa.','%d post still holds legacy content.'=>'Chapisho %d bado lina maudhui ya zamani.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d bado yana maudhui ya zamani.','%d post has a backup.'=>'Machapisho %d yana nakala rudufu.' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d yana nakala rudufu.','%d post could not be handled'=>'Chapisho %d halikuweza kushughulikiwa' . "\0" . 'Machapisho %d hayakuweza kushughulikiwa','Post %d'=>'Chapisho %d','Conversion started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Ubadilishaji umeanza. Unaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuacha ukurasa huu.','Convert legacy content'=>'Badili maudhui ya zamani','Restore every converted post to its legacy content? Changes made to those posts since they were converted will be lost.'=>'Rejesha kila chapisho lililobadilishwa kuwa maudhui yake ya awali? Mabadiliko yaliyofanywa kwa machapisho hayo tangu yalipobadilishwa yatapotea.','Undo started. It continues in the background; you can leave this page.'=>'Tendeni limeanza. Linaendelea chinichini; unaweza kuacha ukurasa huu.','Undo all conversions'=>'Tendua mabadiliko yote','Alert'=>'Tahadhari','Information'=>'Taarifa','Success'=>'Imefanikiwa','Warnings and errors are announced to screen reader users straight away; information and success notices are read when they finish what they are doing.'=>'Maonyo na makosa hutangazwa kwa watumiaji wa visoma skrini mara moja; taarifa na arifa za mafanikio husomwa wanapomaliza kile wanachofanya.','Show icon'=>'Onyesha aikoni','Visitors can close it'=>'Wagenzi wanaweza kuifunga','Title (optional)'=>'Kichwa cha habari (si lazima)','Write the message…'=>'Andika ujumbe…','section — a thematic section'=>'sehemu — sehemu ya maudhui','div — no meaning'=>'div — haina maana','header — introductory content'=>'kichwa cha habari — maudhui ya utangulizi','footer — closing content'=>'kijachini — maudhui ya mwisho','article — self-contained content'=>'makala — maudhui yanayojitegemea','aside — related content'=>'kando — maudhui yanayohusiana','main — the main content (once per page)'=>'main — maudhui kuu (mara moja kwa kila kurasa)','nav — navigation links'=>'urambaza — viungo vya urambazaji','Stack (flexbox, column)'=>'Safu (flexbox, safu wima)','Row (flexbox)'=>'Safu (flexbox)','Grid'=>'Gridi','Layout'=>'Mpangilio','Editing: %s'=>'Inahariri: %s','Lay out children as'=>'Panga vipengele vya ndani kama','Inherited (%s)'=>'Imetolewa kutoka kwa mzazi (%s)','Flexbox'=>'Flexbox','Stacked blocks'=>'Vizuvisi vilivyopangwa','Columns'=>'Nguzo','Drag in the canvas, or type'=>'Buruta kwenye turubai, au andika','Content width'=>'Upana wa maudhui','Boxed (the theme’s content width)'=>'Boxed (upana wa maudhui ya mada)','Full width'=>'Upana kamili','Minimum height'=>'Urefu wa chini','HTML tag'=>'Lebo ya HTML','Link'=>'Unganisha','Make the whole block a link to'=>'Fanya block yote iwe kiungo cha kwenda','Link text for screen readers'=>'Maandishi ya kiungo kwa ajili ya wasomaji skrini','What the link does, for visitors who cannot see the block.'=>'Kile ambacho kiungo hufanya, kwa wageni ambao hawawezi kuona kizuizi hiki.','Open in a new tab'=>'Fungua katika kichupo kipya','Do not put links or buttons inside a linked block: a link inside a link does not work in browsers.'=>'Usiweke viungo au vitufe ndani ya kizuizi kilichounganishwa: kiungo kilicho ndani ya kiungo hakifanyi kazi katika vivinjari.','Drag to resize these columns'=>'Buruta ili kubadilisha ukubwa wa nguzo hizi','Drag to resize this row'=>'Buruta ili kubadilisha ukubwa wa safu hii','Drag across cells to set how many columns and rows this block spans'=>'Buruta kwenye seli ili kuweka idadi ya safu wima na safu mlalo ambazo kizuizi hiki kinachukua','+ Column'=>'Ongeza safu wima','− Column'=>'Safu wima','+ Row'=>'+ Safu','− Row'=>'− Safu mlalo','Switch'=>'Badili','Label'=>'Lebo','Read out by screen readers, and shown when “Show label” is on.'=>'Husomwa na visoma skrini, na huonyeshwa wakati "Onyesha lebo" imewashwa.','Show label'=>'Onyesha lebo','Shortcode tag'=>'Lebo ya msimbo mfupi','Use letters, numbers, dashes and underscores only.'=>'Tumia herufi, namba, vistari na mistari ya chini pekee.','Attribute name'=>'Jina la sifa','Add attribute'=>'Ongeza sifa','Shortcode'=>'Nambari fupi','Choose a shortcode tag in the block settings.'=>'Chagua lebo ya msimbo mfupi katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','The "%s" control from the old editor is not available in the block editor. Enter the value as text.'=>'Udhibiti wa "%s" kutoka kwa kihariri cha zamani haupatikani katika kihariri cha vizuizi. Weka thamani kama maandishi.','Choose image'=>'Chagua picha','Choose file'=>'Chagua faili','— Default —'=>'— Chaguomsingi —','Advanced styling'=>'Mtindo wa kina','Inline CSS'=>'CSS ya Ndani','CSS declarations, for example: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333'=>'Matamshi ya CSS, kwa mfano: min-height: 380px; background-color: #333','Effects (legacy classes)'=>'Madhara (madarasa ya urithi)','Space-separated effect names carried over from older versions, for example: hover-shadow'=>'Majina ya athari yaliyotenganishwa na nafasi tupu yaliyohamishwa kutoka matoleo ya zamani, kwa mfano: hover-shadow','Row'=>'Safu','Width'=>'Upana','Full width, content kept in the middle'=>'Upana wote, maudhui yamewekwa katikati','Link address'=>'Anwani ya kiungo','Link relationship'=>'Uhusiano wa kiungo','Alignment'=>'Mpangilio','Left'=>'Kushoto','Centre'=>'Kituo','Right'=>'Kulia','Button text'=>'Maandishi ya kitufe','Add text…'=>'Ongeza maandishi…','Accessible label'=>'Lebo inayoweza kufikiwa','Leave empty for a decorative icon.'=>'Acha wazi kwa ajili ya ikoni ya urembo.','Choose an icon in the block settings.'=>'Chagua aikoni katika mipangilio ya kizuizi.','New setting name'=>'Jina jipya la mpangilio','For example: title or text'=>'Kwa mfano: kichwa au maandishi','Add setting'=>'Ongeza mpangilio','Widget'=>'Wijeti','Choose a widget'=>'Chagua wijeti','Widget area'=>'Eneo la wijeti','Choose a widget area'=>'Chagua eneo la wijeti','This image has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Choose it from the Media Library, or set its width and height.'=>'Picha hii haina upana wala urefu, kwa hiyo ukurasa utaruka wakati unapakiwa. Ichague kutoka kwenye Maktaba ya Medya, au uweke upana na urefu wake.','This video is not from the Media Library, so its size is unknown and the page will jump when it loads. Upload it to the Media Library instead.'=>'Video hii haitoki kwenye Maktaba ya Medya, kwa hiyo ukubwa wake haujulikani na ukurasa utaruka inapopakia. Ipakie kwenye Maktaba ya Medya badala yake.','An image, video or frame in this HTML has no width and height, so the page will jump when it loads. Add width and height attributes to it.'=>'Picha, video au fremu katika HTML hii haina upana na urefu, kwa hivyo kurasa itaruka inapopakia. Ongeza sifa za upana na urefu kwake.','This embed resizes itself after it loads, which moves the content below it. Give it room or place it lower on the page.'=>'Kibiriti hiki kinajirekebisha ukubwa baada ya kupakia, jambo ambalo linasogeza maudhui yaliyo chini yake. Ipe nafasi au iweke chini zaidi kwenye ukurasa.','Layout shift'=>'Kuhama kwa mpangilio','Desktop'=>'Kompyuta ya Mezani','Default'=>'Chaguo-msingi','Every track'=>'Kila wimbo','Track sizes, for example: 1fr 2fr 200px'=>'Ukubwa wa nyimbo, kwa mfano: 1fr 2fr 200px','Custom track sizes'=>'Ukubwa maalum wa nyimbo','Equal tracks'=>'Nyimbo sawa','One quoted row per line, for example: "head head" "side main". Name the area on each child block.'=>'Safu moja iliyonukuliwa kwa kila mstari, kwa mfano: "head head" "side main". Taja eneo kwenye kila kizuizi tanzu.','Automatic'=>'Otomatiki','Square (1:1)'=>'Mraba (1:1)','Standard (4:3)'=>'Kiwango (4:3)','Classic (3:2)'=>'Classic (3:2)','Wide (16:9)'=>'Upana (16:9)','Cinema (21:9)'=>'Sinema (21:9)','Tall (9:16)'=>'Ndefu (9:16)','Custom'=>'Maalum','Width / height'=>'Upana / urefu','Top'=>'Juu','Bottom'=>'Chini','Background image'=>'Picha ya mandharinyuma','Inherited image — replace'=>'Picha iliyorithiwa — badilisha','Remove image'=>'Ondoa picha','Position'=>'Nafasi','Size'=>'Ukubwa','Cover'=>'Kava','Contain'=>'Weka ndani','Original size'=>'Ukubwa wa asili','Repeat'=>'Rudia','No repeat'=>'Hakuna marudio','Tile'=>'Kigae','Tile across'=>'Tile kote kote','Tile down'=>'Punguza ukubwa','Fixed while scrolling'=>'Imesitishwa wakati wa kusogeza','Solid'=>'Imara','Dashed'=>'Imevunjwa-vunjwa','Dotted'=>'Yenye nukta','Double'=>'Mara mbili','Each side separately'=>'Kila upande kivyake','Side'=>'Upande','Style'=>'Mtindo','Colour'=>'Rangi','Add a shadow'=>'Ongeza kivuli','Horizontal'=>'Mlalo','Vertical'=>'Wima','Blur'=>'Fificha','Spread'=>'Sambaza','Inside'=>'Ndani','Remove this shadow'=>'Ondoa kivuli hiki','Everything'=>'Kila kitu','Colours'=>'Rangi','Opacity'=>'Uwazi','Transform'=>'Badilisha','Shadow'=>'Kivuli','Ease'=>'Urahisi','Linear'=>'Mstari','Ease in'=>'Rahisi kuingia','Ease out'=>'Punguza kasi','Ease in and out'=>'Anza na maliza taratibu','Duration (milliseconds)'=>'Muda (milisekunde)','What animates'=>'Kinachohuisha','Easing'=>'Inayolegeza','Delay (milliseconds)'=>'Kuchelewa (milisekunde)','Remove the preset'=>'Ondoa kigezo kilichowekwa awali','More options'=>'Chaguo zaidi','Number and unit'=>'Nambari na kitengo','Custom CSS value (calc, clamp…)'=>'Thamani ya CSS maalum (calc, clamp…)','Set each side separately'=>'Weka kila upande kando','Set all sides together'=>'Weka pande zote pamoja','All sides'=>'Pande zote','Top start'=>'Juu kushoto','Top end'=>'Kikomo cha juu','Bottom start'=>'Chini kuanzia','Bottom end'=>'Mwisho wa chini','Between rows'=>'Kati ya safu mlalo','Between columns'=>'Kati ya nguzo','Choose a preset'=>'Chagua kigezo cha awali','Presets'=>'Viwango vya Awali','Preset: %s'=>'Kuweka awali: %s','Spacing'=>'Nafasi','Typography'=>'Mitindo ya Maandishi','Colours & background'=>'Rangi na mandhari ya nyuma','Border'=>'Mpaka','Effects'=>'Athari','Advanced'=>'Juu','up to %d px'=>'hadi %d px','from %d px'=>'kutoka %d px','all widths'=>'upana wote','Screen size'=>'Ukubwa wa skrini','Normal'=>'Kawaida','Hover'=>'Elea juu','Reset every value set for %s'=>'Weka upya kila thamani iliyowekwa kwa ajili ya %s','Inherited from %s'=>'Imetoka kwa %s','Reset %s'=>'Weka upya %s','Hide on'=>'Ficha kwenye','%1$s (%2$d set)'=>'%1$s (%2$d imewekwa)','Replace icon'=>'Badilisha aikoni','Choose icon'=>'Chagua aikoni','Choose an icon'=>'Chagua ikoni','No icons match.'=>'Hakuna aikoni zinazolingana.','Regular'=>'Kawaida','Brands'=>'Chapa','Outlined'=>'Imeelezwa kwa mistari','Rounded'=>'Imepindikawa pembe','Sharp'=>'Kali','Bold'=>'Gharibu','Fill'=>'Jaza','Duotone'=>'Duotone','This icon set could not be loaded. Ch