'=>'Wastani (500)','Semi bold (600)'=>'Semi bold (600)','Bold (700)'=>'Kunenana (700)','Extra bold (800)'=>'Nono la ziada (800)','Black (900)'=>'Nyeusi (900)','Gap'=>'Nafasi','Area name'=>'Jina la eneo','Named areas'=>'Maeneo yenye jina','Rows'=>'Safu','Height'=>'Urefu','Offsets'=>'Kodi za Kukabiliana','Justify content'=>'Sawazisha maudhui','Space between'=>'Nafasi kati ya','Space around'=>'Nafasi karibu','Space evenly'=>'Sawazisha nafasi sawia','Letter spacing'=>'Nafasi kati ya herufi','Line height'=>'Urefu wa mstari','Margin'=>'Ukingo','Max height'=>'Urefu wa juu','Max width'=>'Upana wa juu kabisa','Min height'=>'Urefu wa chini kabisa','Min width'=>'Upana wa chini','Order'=>'Weka agizo','Overflow'=>'Kufurika','Visible'=>'Inayoonekana','Clip'=>'Nakili','Scroll when needed'=>'Geuza ukitumia ukurasa unapohitajika','Always scroll'=>'Tembea kila wakati','Padding'=>'Nafasi ya ziada','Place items'=>'Weka vipengele','Relative'=>'Husika','Absolute'=>'Kabisa','Fixed'=>'Imesuluhishwa','Sticky'=>'Inayoshikamana','Corner radius'=>'Kipenyo cha kona','Row span'=>'Upeo wa safu mlalo','Justify'=>'Jaza nafasi','Decoration'=>'Mapambo','Underline'=>'Pigia mstari chini','Overline'=>'Mstari wa juu','Strikethrough'=>'Kuvusha mstari','Text shadow'=>'Kivuli cha matini','Letter case'=>'Herufi kubwa na ndogo','Uppercase'=>'Herufi kubwa','Lowercase'=>'Herufi ndogo','Capitalise'=>'Weka herufi kubwa','Transition'=>'Badilisha','Stack order (z-index)'=>'Mpangilio wa rundo (z-index)','Add screen sizes of your own, such as a large desktop, a landscape tablet or a small phone.'=>'Ongeza saizi zako za skrini, kama vile kompyuta mpana kubwa, kompyuta kibao ya mlalo au simu ndogo.','Applies'=>'Inatumika','up to a width'=>'hadi upana wa','from a width'=>'kutoka kwa upana','Width (px)'=>'Upana (px)','Remove this breakpoint'=>'Ondoa kituo hiki cha kukomelea','Large desktop'=>'Kompyuta kubwa ya mezani','Add a breakpoint'=>'Ongeza mahali pa kuvunjilia','Radial'=>'Mduara','Conic'=>'Conic','Angle (degrees)'=