 gradient'=>'Mtindo wa nyuma wa rangi iliyochanganyika','Add gradient'=>'Ongeza rangi ya mtiririko','Glass'=>'Kioo','Mask'=>'Barakoa','Filters'=>'Vichujio','Wave'=>'Wimbi','Waves'=>'Mawimbi','Curve'=>'Mviringo','Curve (asymmetric)'=>'Jongoo (isiyo lingana)','Arc'=>'Safu ya mviringo','Tilt'=>'Tilt','Tilt (layered)'=>'Tilki (iliyowekwa matabaka)','Triangle (asymmetric)'=>'Pembetatu (isiyo na uwiano)','Split'=>'Gawanya','Zigzag'=>'Zigzag','Mountains'=>'Milima','Clouds'=>'Mawingu','Drops'=>'Matone','Pyramids'=>'Pyramids','Book'=>'Weka nafasi','Stairs'=>'Ngazi','Fan'=>'Kipepeo','Height (px)'=>'Urefu (px)','Mirror'=>'Nakili','Invert'=>'Geuza','In front of the content'=>'Mbele ya maudhui','Source'=>'Chanzo','Video file (MP4 / WebM)'=>'Faili ya video (MP4 / WebM)','Choose MP4 or WebM video'=>'Chagua video ya MP4 au WebM','MP4 address'=>'Anwani ya MP4','WebM address'=>'Anwani ya WebM','YouTube video ID (11 characters)'=>'Kitambulisho cha video ya YouTube (wahusika 11)','Vimeo video number'=>'Nambari ya video ya Vimeo','Visitors only contact the video service when they scroll to this section, and never when their device asks for reduced motion. Until then they see the poster image.'=>'Wagenzi huwasiliana tu na huduma ya video wanapotesea hadi sehemu hii, na kamwe wakati kifaa chao kinapoomba mwendo uliopunguzwa. Hadi wakati huo wanaona picha ya bango.','Replace poster image'=>'Badilisha picha ya bango','Choose poster image'=>'Chagua picha ya bango','Background slideshow'=>'Onyesho la slaidi la nyuma','Change images'=>'Badilisha picha','Choose images'=>'Chagua picha','Choose at least two images.'=>'Chagua angalau picha mbili.','Seconds per image'=>'Sekunde kwa kila picha','Fade'=>'Fifisha','Slide'=>'Teleza','Slow zoom (Ken Burns)'=>'Kuza polepole (Ken Burns)','Remove slideshow'=>'Ondoa onyesho la slaidi','Visitors who ask their device for reduced motion see the first image only.'=>'Wagenzi wanaouliza vifaa vyao mwendo uliopunguzwa huona picha ya kwanza pekee.','Section effects'=>'Madhhara ya sehemu','Top divider'=>'Kigawanyaji cha juu','Bottom divider'=>'Kigawanyiko cha chini','Choose the logo'=>'Chagua nembo','Not set'=>'Haijawekwa','Check the brand colours: each needs a unique name and a valid colour.'=>'Angalia rangi za chapa: kila moja inahitaji jina la kipekee na rangi halali.','Brand name'=>'Jina la chapa','Replace logo'=>'Badilisha nembo','Choose logo'=>'Chagua nembo','A logo is chosen.'=>'Nembo imechaguliwa.','Choose the logo from the Site design page.'=>'Chagua nembo kutoka kwenye ukurasa wa Muundo wa tovuti.','Remove logo'=>'Odoa nembo','Brand colours'=>'Rangi za chapa','Remove %s'=>'Ondoa %s','Brand %d'=>'Chapa %d','Add brand colour'=>'Ongeza rangi ya chapa','Heading font'=>'Fonti ya kichwa cha habari','Body font'=>'Fonti ya mwili','Tone of voice'=>'Mtindo wa sauti','How your brand writes, e.g. “Friendly and plain, short sentences, no jargon.” The AI follows it whenever it writes for this site.'=>'Jinsi chapa yako inavyoandika, mf. “Rafiki na wazi, sentensi fupi, hakuna msamiati mgumu.” AI hufuata hili wakati wowote inapokiandikia tovuti hii.','Brand kit saved.'=>'Kiti cha chapa kimehifadhiwa.','The brand is applied: its colours, fonts and logo are now the site’s.'=>'Chapa imetumika: rangi zake, fonti na nembo yake sasa ni za tovuti.','Apply to site'=>'Tumia kwenye tovuti','All classes'=>'Madarasa yote','Class name on the page'=>'Jina la darasa kwenye ukurasa','Printed as %s.'=>'Imechapishwa kama %s.','Start with a letter; lowercase letters, digits and hyphens only.'=>'Anza na herufi; herufi ndogo, nambari na vikatishwa pekee.','Styles'=>'Mitindo','The style controls are not loaded. Reload the page; if this stays, reinstall the plugin.'=>'Vidhibiti vya mtindo havijapakia. Pakia upya ukurasa; ikiwa hili litaendelea, sakinisha tena programu-jalizi.','Class saved. Every element using it has the new style.'=>'Darasa limehifadhiwa. Kila kipengele kinacholitumia kina mtindo mpya.','Save class'=>'Hifadhi darasa','Class created.'=>'Darasa limeundwa.','New class'=>'Darasa jipya','e.g. Card'=>'k.m. Kadi','Create'=>'Undha','Search classes'=>'Tafuta madarasa','No class matches.'=>'Hakuna darasa linalolingana.','No classes yet. Create one, style it, then add it to any element from its settings.'=>'Hakuna madarasa bado. Unda moja, icheze, kisha uiongeze kwenye kipengele chochote kutoka kwa mipangilio yake.','Edit %s'=>'Hariri %s','Duplicate %s'=>'Nakili %s','Class duplicated.'=>'Daraja limeigwa.','Delete %s'=>'Futa %s','Class deleted.'=>'Darasa limefutwa.','Delete'=>'Futa','Delete the class "%s"? Elements that use it keep their content and lose its styles.'=>'Futa darasa "%s"? Vipengele vinavyoitumית vitaficha maudhui yao na kupoteza mitindo yake.','Only users who may add unfiltered HTML can change custom CSS.'=>'Ni watumiaji pekee wanaoweza kuongeza HTML isiyochujwa ndio wanaoweza kubadilisha CSS maalum.','Some of this CSS will not be used: @import, expression(), javascript: URLs, "<" and unbalanced braces are removed for safety.'=>'Baadhi ya CSS hii haitatumika: @import, expression(), URL za javascript:, alama za "<" na mabano yasiyo na uwiano huondolewa kwa ajili ya usalama.','Upload a font'=>'Pakia fonti','Uploading fonts needs WordPress 6.5 or later.'=>'Kupakia fonti kunahitaji WordPress 6.5 au toleo jipya zaidi.','Font name'=>'Jina la fonti','e.g. Brand Sans'=>'mf. Brand Sans','%s is uploaded and ready to use.'=>'%s imepakiwa na iko tayari kutumika.','Choose a font file (%s)'=>'Chagua faili ya fonti (%s)','Font library'=>'Maktaba ya fonti','%d files'=>'faili %d','Font switched off for the site.'=>'Fonti imezimwa kwa tovuti.','Font switched on for the site.'=>'Font imewashwa kwa tovuti.','Switch off'=>'Zima','Switch on'=>'Washa','Adobe Fonts'=>'Adobe Fonts','Paste the kit id of your Adobe Fonts web project. Its fonts are then loaded from Adobe on your pages.'=>'Bandika kit id ya mradi wako wa wavuti wa Adobe Fonts. Fonti zake kisha hupakiwa kutoka Adobe kwenye kurasa zako.','Your web projects'=>'Miradi yako ya mtandao','Adobe Fonts connected.'=>'Adobe Fonts imeunganishwa.','Adobe Fonts disconnected.'=>'Adobe Fonts imetenganishwa.','Kit id'=>'Kit id','The dark value for "%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'Thamani ya giza kwa ajili ya "%s" si rangi halali.','When a visitor has not chosen'=>'Wakati mgeni hajachagua','Follow the visitor’s device'=>'Fuata kifaa cha mgeni','Dark colours'=>'Rangi nyeusi','Give each colour its dark version. Colours left empty stay the same in both schemes. Dark mode is on as soon as one colour has a dark value.'=>'Mpe kila rangi toleo lake la gizani. Rangi zilizoachwa wazi zinabaki vilevile katika mifumo yote miwili. Hali ya gizani inawashwa mara tu rangi moja inapokuwa na thamani ya gizani.','Dark version of %s'=>'Toleo la giza la %s','Dark mode saved.'=>'Hali ya giza imehifadhiwa.','Page CSS'=>'CSS ya Ukurasa','Global classes'=>'Madarasa ya kimataifa','Classes'=>'Madarasa','Create classes in Site design, then add them here.'=>'Unda madarasa katika Usanifu wa tovuti, kisha uyaongeze hapa.','Custom CSS'=>'CSS Maalum','Write rules for this element. "selector" means this element, e.g. selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — plain declarations apply to the element itself.'=>'Andika sheria kwa kipengele hiki. "selector" inamaanisha kipengele hiki, kwa mfano selector:hover { opacity: .8 } — matangazo ya kawaida yanatumika kwa kipengele chenyewe.','Font files must be %s.'=>'Faili za fonti lazima ziwe %s.','That font file is empty or larger than 10 MB.'=>'Faili hiyo ya fonti haina kitu au ni kubwa zaidi ya MB 10.','Style once, reuse everywhere, change in one place.'=>'Mtindo mara moja, tumia tena kila mahali, badilisha mahali pamoja.','Variables'=>'Vigezo','Named values any element can use.'=>'Maadili yaliyopewa majina ambayo kipengele chochote kinaweza kutumia.','Spacing, radius and shadows'=>'Nafasi, ncha na vivuli','The scales every spacing, corner and shadow picker offers.'=>'Vipimo ambavyo kila kiteuzi cha nafasi, pembe na kivuli kinatoa.','A dark version of your colours, for visitors who want it.'=>'Toleo la rangi zako za giza, kwa wageni wanaolitaka.','Logo, colours, fonts and tone of voice, used by the AI and templates.'=>'Nembo, rangi, fonti na mtindo wa sauti, vinavyotumiwa na AI na templeti.','Upload your own fonts or connect Adobe Fonts.'=>'Pakia fonti zako au unganisha Adobe Fonts.','CSS for this page only.'=>'CSS kwa ukurasa huu pekee.','CSS for this page'=>'CSS ya ukurasa huu','Loaded only on this page, after the site’s styles. Saved with the page.'=>'Imepakiwa kwenye ukurasa huu tu, baada ya mitindo ya tovuti. Imehifadhiwa pamoja na ukurasa.','Short name'=>'Jina fupi','The short name "%s" is used twice.'=>'Jina fupi "%s" linatumika mara mbili.','"%s": short names use lowercase letters, digits and hyphens.'=>'"%s": majina mafupi hutumia herufi ndogo, namba na vistari.','The value of "%s" is not one this setting accepts.'=>'Thamani ya "%s" sio inayokubaliwa na mpangilio huu.','Radius'=>'Radius','Add a step'=>'Ongeza hatua','Scales saved.'=>'Vipimo vimehifadhiwa.','Scales are back to the defaults.'=>'Vipimo vimerejeshwa kwenye viwango vya msingi.','Reset to the default scales'=>'Weka upya kwa mizani chaguomsingi','No variables yet. A variable holds one value — a width, a colour mix, a font size — that many elements share.'=>'Hakuna vigezo bado. Kigezo hushikilia thamani moja — upana, mchanganyiko wa rangi, au ukubwa wa fonti — ambayo vipengele vingi vinashiriki.','Add variable'=>'Ongeza kigezo','Variables saved.'=>'Vigezo vimehifadhiwa.','No colours yet.'=>'Hakuna rangi bado.','Colour %d'=>'Rangi %d','Add colour'=>'Ongeza rangi','Two colours have the same name. Rename one.'=>'Rangi mbili zina jina moja. Badilisha jina la moja wapo.','"%s" is not a valid colour.'=>'"%s" si rangi halali.','Theme colours'=>'Rangi za mandhari','Your theme’s palette. A change here is saved as your site’s version of the colour, the same way the Site Editor saves it, and applies everywhere the colour is used.'=>'Mandhari ya rangi yako. Mabadiliko hapa yanahifadhiwa kama toleo la tovuti yako la rangi hiyo, kwa njia sawa na inavyohifadhiwa na Kihariri cha Tovuti, na yanatumika kila mahali rangi hiyo inapotumika.','Theme colours are back to the theme’s own values.'=>'Rangi za mandhari zimerejeshwa kwenye thamani asili za mandhari hiyo.','Reset theme colours'=>'Weka upya rangi za mandhari','Your colours'=>'Rangi zako','Colours saved.'=>'Rangi zimehifadhiwa.','Pick a colour for %s'=>'Chagua rangi kwa ajili ya %s','Clear'=>'Futa','The change could not be saved.'=>'Mabadiliko hayakuweza kuhifadhiwa.','Close panel'=>'Funga kidirisha','Theme default'=>'Mandhari chaguomsingi','Theme fonts'=>'Fonti za Mandhari','Your fonts'=>'Font zako','Font stack'=>'Mtindo wa fonti','Uploaded font: its files come from the font library.'=>'Font iliyopakia: faili zake zinatoka kwenye maktaba ya fonti.','System sans-serif'=>'Mfumo wa sans-serif','Add font stack'=>'Ongeza safu ya fonti','Fonts saved.'=>'Fonti zimehifadhiwa.','Shared with your theme and the Site Editor.'=>'Imeshirikiwa na mandhari yako na Kihariri cha Tovuti.','Fonts'=>'Fonti','Heading and body fonts for the whole site.'=>'Fonti za kichwa na za mwili kwa tovuti nzima.','Back to Site design'=>'Rudi kwenye Muundo wa Tovuti','Classes, tokens, dark mode, brand kit and custom fonts come with Pro'=>'Madarasa, alama, hali ya giza, kifaa cha chapa na fonti maalum huja na Pro','Open the Site Editor’s styles'=>'Fungua mitindo ya Kihariri cha Tovuti','Heading'=>'Kichwa cha habari','Plain'=>'Wazi','Accent'=>'Lugha','No languages to switch between. The switcher appears when a translation plugin lists two or more languages.'=>'Hakuna lugha za kubadilisha kati yake. Kitufe cha kubadilisha huonekana wakati plagi ya utafsiri inaorodhesha lugha mbili au zaidi.','Switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji','Show the current language'=>'Onyesha lugha ya sasa','Install Tranzly and list two or more languages, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Weka Tranzly na uorodheshe lugha mbili au 