ion'=>'Bandika sehemu','Press Ctrl+V (or Cmd+V on a Mac) here to paste'=>'Bonyeza Ctrl+V (au Cmd+V kwenye Mac) hapa ili kubandika','Copy style'=>'Nakili mtindo','Copy section'=>'Nakili sehemu','Edit in Sandwich Studio'=>'Hariri katika Sandwich Studio','Saving failed. Check your connection and try again; your changes are kept in this browser.'=>'Imeshindwa kuhifadhi. Angalia mtandao wako kisha ujaribu tena; mabadiliko yako yamehifadhiwa kwenye kivinjari hiki.','Published.'=>'Imechapishwa.','Saved.'=>'Imehifadhiwa.','Maintenance and pre-launch mode'=>'Hali ya matengenezo na kabla ya uzinduzi','What visitors see'=>'Kile wageni wanachokiona','The site, as normal'=>'Tovuti, kama kawaida','Maintenance: a notice, and search engines are told to come back later'=>'Matengenezo: taarifa, na injini za utafutaji zinaambiwa zirudi baadaye','Pre-launch: a notice, and search engines are told not to index the site'=>'Uzinduzi wa awali: notisi, na injini za utafutaji zinaambiwa zisiiweke faharasa tovuti hiyo','Page to show instead'=>'Ukurasa wa kuonyesha badala yake','Design any page with the builder and choose it here. Without one, visitors see a short notice with the site’s name.'=>'Sanifu ukurasa wowote ukitumia kijenzi kisha uchague hapa. Bila huo, wageni huona notisi fupi yenye jina la tovuti.','Who still sees the real site (administrators always do):'=>'Ni nani anayeona tovuti halisi bado (wasimamizi hufanya hivyo daima):','Open the site in a private window to see what visitors see.'=>'Fungua tovuti hiyo katika dirisha la faragha ili uone kile wageni wanachokiona.','Network settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio ya mtandao imehifadhiwa.','These settings apply to the %d site in this network.'=>'Mipangilio hii inatumika kwa tovuti ya %d katika mtandao huu.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio hii inatumika kwa tovuti %d katika mtandao huu.','Shared templates'=>'Templeti za pamoja','Patterns saved on the main site that are ticked here appear on every site, under “Network templates”. Each site inserts its