 kama zilivyokuwa','%d setting'=>'mpangilio %d' . "\0" . 'mipangilio %d','Importing will give: %s.'=>'Kuingiza kutatoa: %s.','Imported: %s.'=>'Imetoka nje: %s.','Exported %d item.'=>'Imesafirishwa %d kipengee.' . "\0" . 'Vipengele %d vimesafirishwa.','That file could not be read as an export file.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa kama faili la kutoa nje.','Export'=>'Hamisha nje','Download your templates, patterns and site design as one file, to import on another site.'=>'Pakua violezo vyako, ruwaza na muundo wa tovuti kama faili moja, ili kuleta kwenye tovuti nyingine.','There are no templates or patterns to export yet.'=>'Hakuna violezo au miundo ya kusafirisha nje bado.','Include the settings'=>'Jumuisha mipangilio','Download the export file'=>'Pakua faili la kutoa','Import'=>'Leta','Choose an export file'=>'Chagua faili ya kuisafirisha nje','The file holds %1$d item from %2$s.'=>'Faili hii ina bidhaa %1$d kutoka %2$s.' . "\0" . 'Faili hili lina vipengee %1$d kutoka kwa %2$s.','When an item with the same name already exists here'=>'Kipengele chenye jina lile lile tayari kipo hapa','Keep the one on this site'=>'Weka ile iliyo kwenye tovuti hii','Replace it with the imported one'=>'Ibadilishe na ile iliyoingizwa','Import a copy beside it'=>'Ingiza nakala kando yake','Apply the settings in the file'=>'Tumia mipangilio iliyo kwenye faili','Copy the images into this site’s media library'=>'Nakili picha kwenye maktaba ya midia ya tovuti hii','Show what will happen'=>'Onyesha kitakachotokea','block titleAlert'=>'Taadhari','block descriptionA notice for your visitors: information, success, a warning or an error, with an optional title and a close button.'=>'Taarifa kwa wageni wako: habari, mafanikio, onyo au kosa, pamoja na kichwa cha hiari na kitufe cha kufunga.','block keywordnotice'=>'taarifa','block keywordmessage'=>'ujumbe','block keywordcallout'=>'arifa','block keywordwarning'=>'onyo','block titleButton link'=>'Kiungo cha kitufe','block descriptionA link styled as a button.'=>'Kiungo kilichopambwa kama kitufe.','block keywordbutton'=>'kitufe','block keywordlink'=>'kiungo','block keywordcall to action'=>'wito wa kuchukua hatua','block titleColumn'=>'Safu','block descriptionA column inside a row. It can hold any block.'=>'Safu ndani ya safu mlalo. Inaweza kuwa na kizuizi chochote.','block keywordcolumn'=>'safu wima','block keywordlayout'=>'mpangilio','block titleContainer'=>'Kontena','block descriptionA box that lays out the blocks inside it with flexbox or a grid. Nest containers to build any layout. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Sanduku linalopanga vizuizi vilivyomo ndani yake kwa kutumia flexbox au gridi. Weka vyombo ndani ya vyombo ili kuunda mpangilio wowote. Hubaki kusomeka ikiwa programu-jalizi itazimwa wakati wowote.','block keywordcontainer'=>'kontena','block keywordbox'=>'sanduku','block keywordgrid'=>'grid','block keywordflexbox'=>'flexbox','block keywordcolumns'=>'Safu','block titleLanguage switcher (sample)'=>'Kibadilishaji cha lugha (mfano)','block descriptionLists the site\'s languages from the translation plugin, when one is active. It renders nothing otherwise.'=>'Inaorodhesha lugha za tovuti kutoka kwenye plagi-in ya utafsiri, wakati moja ikiwa amilifu. Haionyeshi chochote vinginevyo.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Lugha','block keywordswitcher'=>'kigeuzi','block titleSample content'=>'Maudhui ya mfano','block descriptionA heading and a paragraph, rendered with neutral class names. It is the reference block for the translation contract.'=>'Kichwa cha habari na aya, vilivyotolewa kwa majina ya darasa yasiyoegemea upande wowote. Nikiwa kizuizi cha marejeleo kwa ajili ya mkataba wa tafsiri.','block keywordsample'=>'mfano','block keywordtext'=>'maandishi','block titleIcon'=>'Ikoni','block descriptionAn SVG icon. The markup is cleaned before it is shown.'=>'Ikoni ya SVG. Alama zake husafishwa kabla ya kuonyeshwa.','block keywordicon'=>'aikoni','block keywordsvg'=>'svg','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Kibadilishaji lugha','block descriptionLets visitors read this page in another language, styled to match your page. Needs the Tranzly plugin for the languages.'=>'Inaruhusu wageni kusoma ukurasa huu katika lugha nyingine, ukiwa umebuniwa kuendana na ukurasa wako. Inahitaji programu jalizi ya Tranzly kwa ajili ya lugha hizo.','block keywordtranslation'=>'tafsiri','block keywordmultilingual'=>'lugha nyingi','block titleDark mode switch'=>'Badilisha kwenda modi ya giza','block descriptionA button that switches the website between its light and dark colours, and remembers the visitor\'s choice.'=>'Kitufe kinachobadilisha tovuti kati ya rangi zake za mwanga na giza, na kukumbuka chaguo la mgeni.','block keyworddark'=>'nyeusi','block keywordlight'=>'mwanga','block keywordcolour scheme'=>'mpango wa rangi','block titleRow'=>'Safu','block descriptionA row of columns. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Safu ya safu wima. Inaendelea kusomeka ikiwa programu-jalizi itazimwa wakati wowote.','block keywordrow'=>'safu','block titleSection'=>'Sehemu','block descriptionA full-width band of the page that lays its content out with flexbox or a grid. Stays readable if the plugin is ever turned off.'=>'Ukanda wa upana wote wa ukurasa unaopanga maudhui yake kwa kutumia flexbox au gridi. Hubaki kusomeka hata kama programu jalizi itazimwa.','block keywordsection'=>'sehemu','block titleShortcode (add-on)'=>'Nambari fupi (jalizo)','block descriptionA shortcode from an add-on written for the classic Page Builder Sandwich editor, with the settings the add-on declared.'=>'Shortcode kutoka kwa kiongezi kilichoandikwa kwa ajili ya kihariri cha kitamaduni cha Page Builder Sandwich, chenye mipangilio ambayo kiongezi hicho kilitangaza.','block keywordshortcode'=>'kodi fupi','block keywordadd-on'=>'nyongeza','block titleWidget area'=>'Eneo la wijeti','block descriptionShows the widgets in one of the theme\'s widget areas.'=>'Inaonyesha wijeti katika moja ya maeneo ya wijeti ya mada.','block keywordsidebar'=>'mwamba wa pembeni','block keywordwidget area'=>'eneo la wijeti','block titleWidget'=>'Wijeti','block descriptionShows one of the site\'s registered classic widgets.'=>'Inaonyesha mojawapo ya wijeti za asili zilizosajiliwa za tovuti.','block keywordwidget'=>'wijeti']];